[OUTPUT] ## general overview of the project Science Library is a software application that serves as a digital library for scientific research papers and publications. It allows users to search and access a wide range of scientific articles and journals from various fields of study. The library also provides categorization and sorting options to help users find relevant research papers easily. Additionally, users can save and organize their favorite articles, create annotations. ## software functional requirements 1. The system shall allow users to search for scientific articles and journals using keywords or phrases. 2. The system shall provide access to scientific articles and journals, enabling users to view the full text of the documents. 3. The system shall categorize research papers by various fields of study, allowing users to filter results based on their area of interest. 4. The system shall allow users to sort research papers using various criteria such as publication date, relevance, or author. 5. The system shall enable users to save their favorite articles for easy access later. 6. The system shall provide functionality for users to organize their saved articles into custom folders or categories. 7. The system shall allow users to create annotations on articles, enabling them to highlight important information or add personal notes. [/OUTPUT]

